freedomnas-core (0.9.12-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Automatic rollback of a kernel update that does not boot: boot
    confirmation and the rollback report for the WebUI
  * Command output streamed while it runs, for the verbose installer
  * Administrators get the groups their features need on every reconcile
  * Pool import reads account names out of Samba's Unix User ACL form
  * An installation's pending setup told apart from an image's

 -- FreedomNAS Team <dev@freedomnas.io>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:18:58 +0000

freedomnas-core (0.9.11-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Advanced networking: interface settings applied under a checkpoint that
    undoes itself unless confirmed, FreedomNAS interface names by MAC
    address, bridges, bonds, VLANs, static routes and a WireGuard VPN,
    all restored by the reconciler
  * SMB shares are restored once smbd answers
  * The shares health check follows the shares that exist

 -- FreedomNAS Team <dev@freedomnas.io>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:41:30 +0000

